miniaudio
---------
examples/miniaudio.h is miniaudio 0.11.24 (2026-01-17) by David Reid,
https://github.com/mackron/miniaudio. Upstream carries it for its examples;
Biorouter compiles it for the terminal's microphone capture. Its author offers
it under a choice of two licences: the Unlicense (public domain) or MIT No
Attribution. Biorouter takes it under MIT No Attribution, Copyright 2025
David Reid, because that grant holds in every jurisdiction, including those
that do not recognise a dedication to the public domain. MIT No Attribution
asks for no notice; this one names it anyway.


Biorouter's changes
-------------------
None. patches/ is empty. A future patch would be applied to a copy of the tree
at build time, never to source/.
